 blend of crucial vitamins & minerals. In addition to electrolytes, muscles need their preferred fuel of carbohydrates. LYTES carbohydrate blend maximizes nutrient absorption and rapidly refuels your muscle’s glycogen levels."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Vegan & Free of Soy, Dairy, Gluten, Artificial Flavors & Colors."},{"type":"Formulation re: Vegetarian/Vegan","notes":"Vegan & Free of Soy, Dairy, Gluten, Artificial Flavors & Colors."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration.\nThis product is not intended to treat or cure any disease."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Plant-Based Electrolyte Blend"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"DAIRY, SOY & GLUTEN FREE"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"WHOLE FOOD DIETARY SUPPLEMENT"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Suggested Use: Mix 1 scoop with 8-16 fluid ounces of ice water and enjoy!"},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"ALLERGEN STATEMENT: Manufactured in a facility that handles: Eggs, Wheat, Milk, Tree Nuts, Peanuts, Soybeans, Crustacean Shellfish, and Fish."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Please Recycle"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Non-GMO"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Made in the USA"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"2015 ATH Organics"}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"},{"langualCode":"P0265","langualCodeDescription":"Structure/Function"}],"events":[{"date":"2016-09-22","type":"Date entered into DSLD"}],"userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"ingredientRows":[{"order":1,"ingredientId":284519,"description":null,"notes":null,"quantity":[{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":15,"opera